    "name": "SSA Field Office Address API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Social Security Administration Field Office Address API provides location data, addresses, telephone numbers, and office hours for SSA Field Offices across the United States. The data is served through the Esri ArcGIS Online platform as a RESTful Feature Service. No authentication required — all data is publicly available.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: SSA Developer Support",
